[Music]  i have plenty of everything including  opinions real housewives of salt lake  city cast member jenny nguyen fired from  the bravo show after her past racist  social media posts resurfaced the  network released this statement on  tuesday announcing bravo ceased filming  with jenny and she will no longer be a  cast member in the franchise continuing  quote we recognize we failed to take  appropriate action once her offensive  social media posts were brought to our  attention moving forward we will work to  improve our processes to ensure we make  better informed and more thoughtful  casting decisions wynn's old posts which  were largely anti-black lives matter  came to light last week sparking her  co-stars to speak out that's was  upsetting for me to see that meredith  marks tweeted the word vile and a couple  days later clarified her tweet in a new  statement writing quote i am sickened by  my co-workers racist and prejudicial  posts that recently surfaced i do not  stand behind or support these posts in  any way shape or form  franchise executive producer andy cohen  also reacted to the controversy on his  radio show the posts were  very upsetting rightfully and disgusting  a source recently told et that the women  of salt lake city are quote outraged  over the posts which became a topic of  conversation as they started filming  their next season our source says jenny  filmed scenes for season three including  a sit-down confrontation with at least  one co-star to discuss the social media  scandal however at this time it's  unclear if or how bravo might use those  scenes they could be cut into season two  which is still airing to wrap up jenny's  story or to leave it on the cutting room  floor  cast member jen shaw also reacted to the  racist post saying she must stand up on  behalf of her husband and sons who are  african-american also writing that she's  quote deeply offended and how quote  infuriating it was to see jenny's  racially insensitive comments on social  media  jenny and i have been friends for over  10 years we were both pregnant together  housewife lisa barlow also released a  statement revealing her disappointment  by the resurface post saying quote the  posts were harmful and hurtful to a  community i love i don't condone those  and i'm completely anti-racist so  you know i hope um everyone does better  but i definitely don't condone those  jenny's posts were reportedly created in  the height of the black lives matter  movement in 2020 and the posts which  have since been deleted from facebook  consisted of racially offensive memes  mocking protesters and comparing them to  thugs wynn apologized for the post  writing quote at the time i thought i  was speaking out against violence but  i've since learned how offensive and  hurtful my words were i regret those  posts and am sincerely sorry for the  pain they caused you know my family's  toy stuff when e.t spoke with meredith  marks ahead of season two she opened up  about what it was like to have wynn step  in as a new member of the cast and her  attempt at playing peacemaker between  marx and jen shaw's heated fight i think  it's a little bit tricky when someone  who is  new to a group is trying to navigate  issues that were pre-existing  so um  i don't know i mean given the  circumstances you know  it's very heated  um you know  i am not one who gets easily agitated  but when you've pissed me off watch out  like it's not a joke  and um and i was there um so  given all the circumstances i i kind of  have to give jenny a little credit there  because  you know  it was not an easy situation so you know  bless her for trying i mean  it was tough

